# vtium starts on a VT and a shell runs in it: the first guide, for the
# minspec slice (#68). #21 adds the steps for what it wires in.
#
#   make vt-check GUIDE=start

title: vtium starts and runs a shell

step: The first screen
do: read this screen from top to bottom.
expect: every line drawn in full, in one font, with no stray characters and
expect: nothing left from the console that ran on VT {vt} before.

step: A shell prompt
probe: shell
do: press Enter. At the prompt "vtium-check$ " type: echo hello vtium
do: then Enter, then type exit and Enter.
expect: the prompt, each key shown as you type it, "hello vtium" on the
expect: next line, a new prompt, and back here after exit.
